<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-BORDEAUX SIGN TWO MORE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BORDEAUX SIGN TWO MORE.</headline>
<dateline>BORDEAUX, France 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bordeaux announced two more recruits on Monday, Dutch midfielder Kiki Musampa and French under-21 international Sylvain Wiltord.</p>
<p>Musampa signed a four-year contract with the French first division club from Ajax.</p>
<p>Wiltord was transferred from Rennes to Deportivo La Coruna last season but the promising striker did not play a single match for the Spanish team.</p>
</text>
